flowchart TB
    A[GM Classification Dashboard] --> B{New Work / Management Action?}
    B --> C[Create Project]
    C --> C1[Validate project data + scope + rules + team]
    C1 --> C2[Atomic DB transaction]
    C2 --> C3[Project ACTIVE]
    C3 --> C4[Milestones generated]
    C4 --> C5[Internal + linked stakeholder notifications]

    B --> PA[Plan Appraisal]
    PA --> PA1[GM receives drawing / revision]
    PA1 --> PA2[GM forwards to Department Manager]
    PA2 --> DM1[DM receives version in authenticated Inbox]
    DM1 --> DM2[Check Engineer authorization + competency + availability/workload]
    DM2 --> DM3[Assign specific Authorized Engineer]
    DM3 --> ENG[Engineer technical appraisal]
    ENG --> ENGQ{Engineer result?}
    ENGQ -->|Observation / appraisal issue| DM4[DM reviews engineer appraisal]
    ENGQ -->|Technically complete| DM4
    DM4 --> DMQ{DM decision?}
    DMQ -->|Requires changes| EFB[DM feedback to Engineer]
    EFB --> ENG
    DMQ -->|Design rejected / amended| GMD[DM forwards recommendation to GM]
    GMD --> GMD2[GM sends to Designer for correction]
    GMD2 --> DES[Designer submits controlled revision]
    DES --> REV[New revision stored + previous revision superseded]
    REV --> DM1
    DMQ -->|Appraisal approved| GMA[DM forwards to GM for final approval]
    GMA --> GMDQ{GM decision?}
    GMDQ -->|Approve| APPR[Drawing Approved + Revision Locked]
    GMDQ -->|Send to Designer| GMD2

    B --> SR[Survey RFI]
    SR --> SR1[GM forwards Survey RFI to DM]
    SR1 --> DM5[DM reviews scope + survey type]
    DM5 --> DM6[Check Surveyor specialization + authorization + competency + availability]
    DM6 --> DM7[Assign specific Authorized Surveyor + schedule]
    DM7 --> SURV[Surveyor conducts survey + submits report/evidence]
    SURV --> DM8[DM reviews report + observations]
    DM8 --> DMQ2{Observations?}
    DMQ2 -->|No| GM2[DM forwards to GM for final approval]
    DMQ2 -->|Yes| GM2
    GM2 --> GMR{GM decision?}
    GMR -->|Approve| CERTQ{Open observations?}
    CERTQ -->|No| CERT[GM issues Full Class Certificate]
    CERTQ -->|Yes| ICERT[GM issues Interim Certificate]
    GMR -->|Send back| CA[GM creates controlled corrective-action task for DM]
    CA --> DM9[DM assigns corrective action to Surveyor / Ship Management]
    DM9 --> CA2[Assignee submits evidence]
    CA2 --> DM10[DM verifies corrective action]
    DM10 --> FU[Follow-up RFI created]
    FU --> DM5

    B --> MON[DM Project Monitoring]
    MON --> DELAY{Delay / issue?}
    DELAY -->|No| CONT[Continue regular workflow]
    DELAY -->|Yes| ESC[DM escalates to GM with reason + recommendation + severity]
    ESC --> GMESC[GM reviews escalation]

    AUTH[Authorization Matrix] --> DM2
    COMP[Competency Matrix] --> DM2
    AVAIL[Availability + Workload Engine] --> DM2
    AUTH --> DM6
    COMP --> DM6
    AVAIL --> DM6

    NOTIF[Authenticated In-App Notifications] -.-> PA2
    NOTIF -.-> SR1
    NOTIF -.-> ESC
